Implement STT
	1. STT button appears besides send button (handle by AIchatsidepanel)
		1. On press it becomes read until pressed again 
	2. On press button triggers a permission to access mircrophone
        1. send a boolean to a function indicating mic is pressed.
        2. use 
	3. When granted button starts recording
		- The recording is sent to the LLM as a normal text
		- The recording triggers a function that parses voice to text in the frontend .
	4. When not it come backs again to its normal state